h_1 – Ritual buffering (Cultural Ritual Frequency, Astro‑Exile Grief, -1) Private observances tied to Euphorian custom
h_2 – Survivor guilt and withdrawal (Perceived Responsibility for Others’ Deaths, Interpersonal Withdrawal, +1) Actarus’s torment after escaping while his family and people were killed
h_3 – Adoptive support as a moderator (Presence of Substitute Kinship Structure \times Time Since Loss, Exile Grief Trajectory, -1) Procyon’s adoption of Actarus; operates through relational rather than ritual mechanisms
